   "t": "{{main}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1042,
   "src": "de1a88cb2249",
   "t": "We took readings at several points."
  },
  {
   "i": 1045,
   "src": "c064ee7ac21f",
   "t": "The differences gave us the distance."
  },
  {
   "i": 1053,
   "src": "d947745394fc",
   "t": "The reaction is right below or above us."
  },
  {
   "i": 1056,
   "src": "1b7cae083d7e",
   "t": "The distance is about 180 meters."
  },
  {
   "i": 1063,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1069,
   "src": "824fbc69cb07",
   "t": "O-one hundred eighty meters? Are you\nserious..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1080,
   "src": "d6e0ab60f79f",
   "t": "A mere shovel won't get us anywhere."
  },
  {
