   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1094,
   "src": "09f5caebf189",
   "t": "...Hey."
  },
  {
   "i": 1102,
   "src": "e29bb422e657",
   "t": "Weren't they saying the mine was"
  },
  {
   "i": 1105,
   "src": "66e4e9540a05",
   "t": "exhausted? How can this much be left?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1121,
