   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1156,
   "src": "45ecaaff5853",
   "t": "Huh? ...Ah, yeah."
  },
  {
   "i": 1159,
   "src": "8d724ff961b7",
   "t": "It's ancient, so it's not very clear, but..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1167,
   "src": "45c24664c349",
   "t": "Judging from the surrounding {{terrain}},"
  },
  {
   "i": 1170,
   "src": "b06e7c956bbb",
   "t": "I think this is the crater's dead center."
  },
  {
   "i": 1184,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1190,
   "src": "f3fff40e550a",
   "t": "I see, I see."
  },
  {
   "i": 1193,
   "src": "7348ed10f2c7",
   "t": "So..."
  },
  {
